BEGIN:VCALENDAR
VERSION:2.0
PRODID:-//WorkBuddy//Game Version Calendar//EN
CALSCALE:GREGORIAN
METHOD:PUBLISH
X-WR-CALNAME:Gacha Version Calendar - All
X-WR-CALDESC:Preview streams and version updates. Leaving a game? On iPhone
  just delete that calendar. On Android\, switch OFF "show" in Calendar acc
 ount settings instead of tapping Delete - deleting one URL subscription re
 moves all of them.
X-WR-TIMEZONE:Asia/Shanghai
REFRESH-INTERVAL;VALUE=DURATION:PT6H
X-PUBLISHED-TTL:PT6H
